      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2. The Defendant should pay the Claimant's costs of the application for the Permission to Appeal",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Application to be assessed as follows:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b4",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(a) The Claimant is to file and serve a Statement of Costs and any short submissions in support of",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b5",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "the cost claimed within 21 days of the date of this Order;",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(b) The Defendant shall provide any submissions in response to the costs claimed within 14 days",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b7",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "of the service of the Statement of Costs; and",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(c) The Claimant is to provide any submissions in reply to the Defendant's response within 7 days",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b9",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "of service of that response.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b10",
