      "text": "Issued by:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b13",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Delvin Sumo",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b14",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Assistant Registrar",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b15",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Date of Issue: 2 February 2026",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b16",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "At: 11am",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b17",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "SCHEDULE OF REASONS",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b18",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "1. This is an application by the Defendant for permission to appeal against that part of my Order with",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b19",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Reasons dated 9 December 2025 which granted declarations as to the meaning of the PSA",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b20",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "substantially as sought by the Claimant. No permission is sought against that part of the Order which",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b21",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "refused immediate judgment for a money sum.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b22",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "2. The test for the grant of permission to appeal is that the Court must consider that the appeal would",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b23",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "have a real prospect of success or there is some other compelling reason why the appeal should be",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b24",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "heard in accordance with Rule 44.19 of the Rules of the DIFC Courts (\"RDC\"). A real prospect of",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b25",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "success means that there is a realistic rather than fanciful prospect of success and requires more than",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b26",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "mere arguability.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b27",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "3. Judgment on the issues of construction in favour of the Claimant was given pursuant to RDC",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b28",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "24.1(b) which required that I considered that the Defendant had no real prospect of defending the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b29",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "issues of construction. The applicable test is, accordingly, materially the same as that for granting",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "permission to appeal.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b31",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "4. The conclusions which I reached in relation to matters of construction were, in my view, clear once",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b32",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "the rival construction arguments were considered. I have considered carefully the three grounds of",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b33",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "appeal. I do not consider that any of them affords the Defendant a realistic prospect of succeeding in",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p2-b34",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "the Court of Appeal:",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p3-b1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "(a) Ground 1 alleges that the construction I reached lacked commercial common sense with the",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p3-b2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "result that a different construction should have been reached. I do not agree. The bargain made",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p3-b3",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "was unique and each party's case involved some possibly surprising commercial consequences.",
      "bbox": null,
      "heading_level": null,
      "linked_content_id": null
    },
    {
      "node_id": "1b446e196b4d1752241c8ff689a31ea705e98ad0c16b9d343c303664f72b64a1-p3-b4",
